{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "245335c3-1d2c-8368-a07d-169bb478d5bb",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T10:57:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Marisol Quintero. I want to report a hole in the street, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Ms. Quintero. Where is the hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 161 Memorial Boulevard. By Easton's Beach, the side near the beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "161 Memorial Boulevard. Okay. Tell me about the hole. How big is it, and where in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is big, in the road near the crosswalk. Right now it is full of water. You cannot see it good. A car can go in, I think, and break the wheel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's filled with water and hard to see. Got it. Is it in the travel lane or toward the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the lane, close to the edge. Please, can you say again? I want to be sure I understand the question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Is the hole in the middle of the lane where cars drive, or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:55:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yes. Closer to the curb. But cars go around it, so they go wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, near the curb, and drivers swerving around it. I'll write that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Also, one more thing. The paint on the crosswalk, it is old. Faded. Almost no white. And the cars, they do not stop for people. I walk there, and I wait a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The crosswalk paint has faded and cars aren't stopping. That's important. I'll note it with the report so the crew can look at both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, can you put the street on the list for repair? The repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add it to the list for pothole repair, yes. Crews go by the reports in order, and with the weather this time of year, the water in it may make it harder to patch right away. But it's on the list as of today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today is Thursday, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Thursday, the twelfth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:56:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Sorry, one moment. My tablet, it is updating again. It does this always, at the wrong time. [pause] Okay, now it is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Let me read it back. Pothole filled with water, near the curb in the lane, at 161 Memorial Boulevard, and faded crosswalk paint nearby where cars don't stop. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's done? I have a number here, but I can confirm it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0155. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you very much, Miss Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Quintero. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:57:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
